WEBVTT

00:06:29.109 --> 00:06:30.452
This is still going to work, though.

00:06:30.452 --> 00:06:32.735
I think this is still going to work, mostly.

00:06:32.735 --> 00:06:35.888
So Gwen, I'm going to hand you this envelope.

00:06:35.888 --> 00:06:38.840
Don't open it yet. Do not open it yet,

00:06:38.840 --> 00:06:41.231
but I am going to write down your choices

00:06:41.231 --> 00:06:43.390
so that everybody can see

00:06:43.390 --> 00:06:44.663
the choices that you made.

00:06:44.663 --> 00:06:53.046
Okay, great. So we have a cobalt horse,

00:06:53.046 --> 00:06:58.452
amber owl,

00:06:58.452 --> 00:07:03.233
a silver ox,